{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115717","id":3233432052,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7AukH0","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115717","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115717.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115717.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115717","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115717/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115717/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115717/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e40041d27e173a6223021744d0451a49d9065dd4","number":115717,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Multiplayer: Fix node not found error in `process_simplify_path`","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fix: #98052.\r\n\r\nWhen developing a multiplayer game, \"Node not found\" error occurs sometimes and the synchronizer stops working.\r\n\r\nThis is because the authority peer sends the `NETWORK_COMMAND_SIMPLIFY_PATH` only once (per synchronizer) to other peers — whose corresponding nodes may not yet exist at that time — meaning those peers miss the only opportunity to execute `process_simplify_path` successfully.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes this by having the authority peer send the `NETWORK_COMMAND_SIMPLIFY_PATH` to other peers continuously until the latter echo the `NETWORK_COMMAND_CONFIRM_PATH`.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4332209698,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAjhGIg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:multiplayer","name":"topic:multiplayer","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starr